NAME
    scheduler - Read permitted scheduler information.

SYNOPSIS
    scheduler | threads [status]

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Runs as an isolated userland command and issues Get(command.scheduler.get). It reports scheduler information allowed to the calling process; it is not a scheduler administration interface.

ALIASES
    threads

FILES
    /System/Commands/SCHED.CMD
    /INU/HELP/SCHED.MAN
